  "email2": {
    "subject": "Why we started Pristine Wellness",
    "heading": "How it all began",
    "body": "Hi again,\n\nWe wanted to tell you a little about why this site exists.\n\nLike most families, we were busy, tired and doing what everyone else was doing. Packaged food because it was quick. Screens late into the night. Water straight from the tap without a second thought. We weren't unwell, but we didn't feel the way we knew we could.\n\nSo we started asking questions. How did people live before all of this? What did our grandparents eat? What happens when you swap one small habit at a time? Pristine Wellness is where we share what we've found, in our own words and with our own family as the test kitchen.\n\nNone of it is a rule book. It's our opinion, backed by the research and examples we trust, and you're welcome to take what resonates and leave the rest.",
    "btn_text": "Read our story",
    "btn_link": "https://pristinewellness.com.au/about.html",
    "delay_days": 3,
